      <dc:subject><rdf:Bag><rdf:li>eje intestino-cerebro, perros, gatos, transporte internacional, microbiota, estres neuroendocrino, HPA, disbiosis, lipidosis hepatica, psicobioticos</rdf:li></rdf:Bag></dc:subject>
